# Image Pipeline Failure

Use the [image pipeline runbook](https://example.com/runbook/images) for escalation details.

![Diagram of the image pipeline and its processing stages](assets/pipeline.png)
*Figure 1: Image pipeline processing flow.*

## Recovery checks

1. Confirm the source images are available and the pipeline can read them.
2. Retry a failed image and verify that the output is generated and accessible.